  <ArticleWrap>

<h1>Best AI Tools for Startups 2026</h1>
<p><em>Last updated: November 18, 2026 · Last verified: November 18, 2026 — pricing checked against each vendor's official pricing page</em></p>

<p>A startup does not need an AI strategy. It needs to ship a demo, get a landing page in front of people, answer support email, and keep the burn low while doing it. Those four jobs are now mostly automated, and the tools that do them cost less than a single day of contractor time.</p>

<p>This guide covers the nine tools we see actually retained at seed stage — not the ones that get signed up for and abandoned in week two. Every price was checked against the vendor's own pricing page on 18 November 2026, and where a free tier has a real limit we have stated the limit rather than calling it "generous".</p>

